        "date": "2026-11-09T03:57:31Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): judge the tool-number clash per machine, not over the whole program\n\nTwo setups on different machines are two tool tables: the same T number\non each now posts as two files. Within one machine (even across two\nposts) a shared number still refuses by name, prefixed with the mount.\nA single-machine program refuses with the unchanged #221 message.\n\nFixes #438\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
